# .trivyignore — Python image
# Format: CVE-ID  [expiry-date]  # reason
#
# Add accepted/deferred CVEs here with a justification comment and optional
# expiry date (YYYY-MM-DD). Entries without an expiry must be reviewed
# quarterly. Never suppress CRITICAL CVEs without an approved exception.
#
# Example:
# CVE-2023-XXXXX 2025-06-01 # false-positive in unused component; upstream fix pending
